        <item>
            <title>Version 1.12.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:33:08 GMT</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>19</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.12.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/dwarvesf/hidden/releases/tag/v1.12.0</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
<li>A redesigned Settings window.</li>
<li>Hiding works again while an app keeps the microphone open (Wispr Flow, Krisp, Discord...).</li>
<li>Switching from the App Store version offers to import your settings.</li>
<li>macOS 27: pinned sections (beta) keep icons where you put them after apps restart.</li>
<li>Fixes for macOS 26 and earlier.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
